{"name":"The Keyword Bell","slug":"glyph-keyword-bell","blurb":"On the census street, Pike carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Keyword. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Keyword Bell.","seal":"be3777ab618a402f151c69bf88eb9635c1f42814b9406936fa6f9926a98524e1"}
